prompt:
Turn these notes into a Linear ticket body with these sections: Background, Goal, Proposal (numbered steps), Open Questions, Next Steps. Skip a section if the notes have nothing for it. Plain, conversational, no em dashes. Output only the ticket body in markdown.

Notes:
{selection}

Draft a short Slack reply to the message below. Warm and brief, plain language, lowercase is fine for short replies. Answer what was asked. If something is unclear, ask one direct question. No em dashes, no emoji unless it fits. Output only the reply.

Message:
{selection}
